2026-06-25 18:13:34,255 | AGENT | TechnicalArchitect Agent answered: To design a technical architecture that meets the client's requirements, we will leverage our expertise in AI/ML systems, Cloud architecture, API integration, Data engineering, and Cybersecurity. 

Firstly, we can utilize our experience with LLMs, specifically models like Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3, CamemBERT, and Falcon, to develop an intelligent assistance tool that provides accurate and relevant responses to user queries. We will also employ RAG frameworks such as LangChain, LlamaIndex, or Haystack to enhance the performance and efficiency of our LLM models.

